es": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.2, "text": "far distance and seeing the moon up close."}, {"start": 3.36, "end": 17.4, "text": "I think the impressions I get first of the Earth is that it's a very small and a very fragile planet and should be treated as such, very small object."}, {"start": 18.18, "end": 24.88, "text": "And the moon, as I think back on it, I don't really think of it so much as a place, as a direction."}, {"start": 25.22, "end": 33.6, "text": "I think the moon to me represents out there and at this stage in the development..."}, {"start": 35.26, "end": 36.7, "text": "I'm very much pro Mars."}, {"start": 37.0, "end": 53.84, "text": "I think that this country should establish now a long-range goal with no firm timetable but a long-range goal of exploring and setting up a colony on Mars and invite participation by other nations."}, {"start": 54.14, "end": 68.46, "text": "And that is the one goal that to me I think would have a unifying and perhaps even an electrifying effect upon NASA, this country, our space program and space business around the globe."}, {"start": 72.19, "end": 74.15, "text": "I'd certainly like to see a great..."}, {"start": 74.15, "end": 79.35, "text": "Well, it's human nature to adapt very quickly to new situations."}, {"start": 79.43, "end": 93.13, "text": "We sort of are amazed by and thralled by then bored by and eventually forget some new things usually within one revolution of the Earth around the Sun."}, {"start": 94.03, "end": 95.53, "text": "That's the way humans are."}, {"start": 97.29, "end": 101.77, "text": "And so it's a great surprise to me that so many people remember something that I've never seen before."}], "peaks": [{"t": 53.0, "db_over": 9.4, "line": "I think that this country should establish now a long-range goal with no firm timetable but a long-range goal of exploring and setting up a colony on Mars and invite participation by other nations."}, {"t": 100.0, "db_over": 7.4, "line": "And so it's a great surprise 